<title>USA: U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS - Issues to Watch - Dec 26.</title>
<headline>U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS - Issues to Watch - Dec 26.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stocks to watch this morning:</p>
<p>-- Watson Pharmaceuticals Inc said it was in a definitive pact to buy Royce Laboratories for $7.25 a share. Royce shares closed at 6-3/16 on Tuesday. Watson shares closed at 43-1/2.</p>
<p>-- Culbro Corp said its General Cigar Holdings unit has filed for an initial public offering of stock.</p>
<p>Culbro shares closed at 57-5/8.</p>
</text>
